  "description": "Novation Bass Station II, every control change and NRPN in its user guide's MIDI parameters list that prints its range.",
  "sources": [
    {
      "type": "manual",
      "title": "Bass Station II User Guide v5",
      "notes": "MIDI parameter table (pages 71-74) read by tools/profiles/novation/read-novation-pdf.mjs from bass_station_ii_user_guide_v5_en.pdf (sha256 3a1555cb0f234c1a8956018d0583e01e36958344b5c31a5b1ab676b99197487e), https://downloads.novationmusic.com/novation/synthesisers/bass-station-ii. Not yet checked against the instrument itself."
    }
  ],
  "testedWith": [],
  "authoringNotes": [
    "Generated by tools/profiles/novation/make-profiles.mjs; edit the layout in tools/profiles/novation/synths/, not this file.",
    "Every parameter is a row of the guide's MIDI parameter table, with its printed name. Nothing here has been sent to a real instrument yet.",
    "No identity check: the guide prints no Device Inquiry reply.",
    "9 CC pair(s) are the coarse controller alone, 0 - 127: each pair is a controller and its partner 32 above, MIDI's coarse and fine, and the Circuit Mono Station's guide says the second \"is used to create an 8-bit message for a 0-255 value range\" without saying which bit it carries. osc 1 level (CC 20, fine CC 52); osc 2 level (CC 21, fine CC 53); sub osc level (CC 22, fine CC 54); noise level (CC 23, fine CC 55); ring mod level (CC 24, fine CC 56); external signal level (CC 25, fine CC 57); frequency (CC 16, fine CC 48); LFO 1 speed (CC 18, fine CC 50); LFO 2 speed (CC 19, fine CC 51).",
    "Left out, not a control change or an NRPN (a program change, pitch bend, aftertouch, or none): patch inc (prog change ), patch dec (prog change ), pitch (pitchb end ), after touch (afterto uch ).",
    "Left out, a range printed as the value shown, not the value sent: osc 1 fine (cc 26:58): -100 to 100* (to 1 dec place, no 0 for ints), osc 1 Mod Env depth (cc 71): -63 to +63*, osc 1 LFO 1 depth (cc 28:60): -127 to 127*, osc 1 Mod Env PW mod amount (cc 72): -63 to 63*, osc 1 LFO 2 PW mod amount (cc 73): -90 to 90 (MIDI val of 63 & 64 = 0%), osc 2 fine (cc 29:61): -100 to 100* (to 1 dec place, no 0 for ints), osc 2 Mod Env depth (cc 76): -63 to +63*, osc 2 LFO 1 depth (cc 31:63): -127 to 127*, osc 2 env 2 PW mod amount (cc 77): -63 to +63*, osc 2 LFO 2 PW mod amount (cc 78): -90 to 90 (MIDI val of 63 & 64 = 0%), Mod Env depth (cc 85): -63 to +63*, LFO 2 depth (cc 17:49): -127 to 127*, Mod Wh LFO 1 Osc Pitch (NRPN 0:70): -63 to +63, Mod Wh Osc 2 Pitch (NRPN 0:78): -63 to +63, Aftertouch Filter Freq (NRPN 0:74): -63 to +63, Aftertouch LFO 1 to Osc Pitch (NRPN 0:75): -63 to +63.",
    "Left out, printed without a range: osc 1 coarse (cc 27:59), osc 1 manual PW amount (cc 74), osc 2 coarse (cc 30:62), osc 2 manual PW amount (cc 79), sub osc oct (cc 81), osc tuning error (NRPN 0:111), paraphonic mode (NRPN 0:107), osc glide divergence (NRPN 0:113), sub-osc coarse (NRPN 0:84), sub-osc fine (NRPN 0:77), slope (cc 106), filter tracking (NRPN 0:108), portamento time (cc 5), LFO 1 delay (cc 86), LFO 2 delay (cc 87), LFO 1 wave (cc 88), LFO 2 wave (cc 89), amp env triggering (NRPN 0:73), amp env retrigger (NRPN 0:109), amp env fixed sustatin duration (NRPN 0:114), amp env retrigger count (NRPN 0:117), Mod Env triggering (NRPN 0:105), Mod Env retrigger (NRPN 0:110), Mod Env fixed sustain duration (NRPN 0:115), Mod Env retrigger count (NRPN 0:118), Osc Filter Mod (cc 115), on (cc 108), latch (cc 109), rhythm (cc 119), note mode (cc 118), octaves (cc 111), Mod Wh LFO 2 Filter Freq (NRPN 0:71), Aftertouch LFO 2 Speed (NRPN 0:76), Speed/Sync LFO 1 (NRPN 0:87), Speed/Sync LFO 2 (NRPN 0:91), Slew LFO 1 (NRPN 0:86), Slew LFO 2 (NRPN 0:90), Velocity Amp Env (cc 112), Velocity Mod Env (cc 113), Arp Swing (cc 116).",
    "Left out, its values named but not numbered: osc 1 waveform (NRPN 0:72): sine, tri, saw, pulse, osc 2 waveform (NRPN 0:82): sine, tri, saw, pulse, sub osc wave (cc 80): sine, pulse, square, Type (cc 83): Classic, acid, shape (cc 84): LP, BP, HP, Key Sync LFO 1 (NRPN 0:89): OFF or On, Key Sync LFO 2 (NRPN 0:93): OFF or On, Osc 1-2 Sync (cc 110): OFF or On.",
    "Left out, an NRPN printed without its MSB: LFO 1 Sync value (NRPN 87), LFO 2 Sync value (NRPN 91), Seq Retrig (NRPN 106).",
    "Left out, the guide's `mod  cc 0`, which would be sent as MIDI's bank select (the mod wheel is CC 1; a misprint): mod (cc 0).",
    "Left out, the sustain pedal: sustain (cc 64)."
  ],
